frame "Addison: sociology can become foundational for the project's philosophy; Granovetter first, since weak ties are the bridges of philosophy/rhizome.py" reading "ANALOGY (a reading): a tie between clusters carries what no strong tie can; the same shape as a rhizome bridge. This is a reading, not checked" -> 3 label open reach 3 cost 40
